    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "192888c9e6ff386b",
      "translationZh": "完整指南集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca707893aaf9b56c",
      "translationZh": "已饱和",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "192888c9e6ff386b",
      "translationZh": "完整指南集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8791315a631043af",
      "translationZh": "观察 SGC 列可以发现，这个更严格的指标通常比 TGC 变化更大——DeepSeek 的 SGC 跃升了 +16.1pp，而 TGC 提升了 +9.5pp——因为好的指南尤其能帮助智能体通过某个场景的所有变体，而不只是提升平均表现。而且，这种效果在接近上限时也不会消失：GPT-5.5 和 Opus 的 TGC 都已接近上限，但它们的 SGC 仍分别提升了 +7.2 和 +7.1pp。只要模型还有可针对的失败模式，记忆就会持续带来收益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fc364911652e8440",
      "translationZh": "成本最低的记忆策略也可能是最好的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5125fec0d08dc53a",
      "translationZh": "一个实际问题是：注入完整指南集会增加每个 ReAct 步骤的输入量，因为每一轮都会重新发送这些指南。以下是我们的观察结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87e89abb4c1c551f",
      "translationZh": "配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2170aa6763ec8f4a",
      "translationZh": "每项任务的 Token 数（基线）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "386c68c5b5d0c718",
      "translationZh": "每项任务的 Token 数（+ 记忆）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bdddc69f7ff6bb4",
      "translationZh": "额外开销",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "192888c9e6ff386b",
      "translationZh": "完整指南集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "192888c9e6ff386b",
      "translationZh": "完整指南集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4e0083fd58e5298",
      "translationZh": "精选检索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f25123a95b40a8e",
      "translationZh": "表 1. 每项任务的平均 token 用量，跨智能体步骤累计，并与无记忆基线进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b4dfa29a9856209",
      "translationZh": "两点结论：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b0d5be440df3078",
      "translationZh": "精选检索使成本保持在基线附近。对于较弱的模型，筛选在准确率上胜出的同时，也在成本上胜出——两全其美（gpt-oss-120b 的 TGC 提高了 16.1 个百分点，而 token 用量仅增加 5%）。这里的性能提升并不需要更高的推理成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "777c1b4c90cb5f07",
      "translationZh": "记忆不会使推理循环急剧膨胀。DeepSeek 在有记忆和无记忆时执行的 ReAct 步骤数基本相同（平均约为 18–19 步），因此，增加的成本来自输入 token 用量膨胀，而不是更长的轨迹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4f4a9e1cc61ca2b",
      "translationZh": "生产环境中真正能撬动效率的手段是提示词缓存：指南集的静态部分在各个步骤中完全相同，可以缓存，从而大幅降低实际成本。值得专门投入工程工作，设计适配缓存的提示词——保持共享的指南集前缀稳定，使其持续满足缓存条件。我们还假设，上下文窗口大小也会起作用：窗口较大的模型可能更有效地吸收完整的指南集，而上下文较小的模型则更受益于能使注入内容保持精简的检索。我们尚未开展隔离这一因素的受控实验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b3c4f47c032b4f59",
      "translationZh": "记忆应当经过校准，而非仅仅不断积累",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8f1381f539dd0d8",
      "translationZh": "这里的启示不是把智能体学到的一切都交给它，而是给它实际能够利用的适量经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebb62603e6ede9b9",
      "translationZh": "对于较弱的模型，这意味着一个精简的核心，加上少量针对具体任务的经验——恰好，这也是成本最低的选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5820c6f92ba270ff",
      "translationZh": "对于仍有提升空间的强模型，这意味着保留完整的指导原则集，并通过提示缓存将生产环境中的成本维持在可承受的水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "838e2a7072ad29ce",
      "translationZh": "对于已达到饱和状态的模型，这意味着在更充分地理解其剩余的失败模式之前，不再消耗额外的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1287a050163a52e",
      "translationZh": "这些提升在各方面都实实在在——自动实现、无数据泄漏，而且不需要人工标注——但前提是剂量要适合模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22cf4040e2249bde",
      "translationZh": "下一步",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97916347cf2d5c25",
      "translationZh": "这是起点，而不是终点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26ebd90f15ede8d0",
      "translationZh": "通过学习得到的选择器。我们当前的检索方法按余弦相似度对指导原则排序，但我们已经表明，这并不能完美预测哪些指导原则有助于完成某项任务。用结果信号训练选择器，是顺理成章的下一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b192f9ad32ea126a",
      "translationZh": "面向能力很弱的模型的记忆。在低于最低能力基线的情况下，自蒸馏缺乏信号。为能力很弱的模型构建由教师模型蒸馏而来的记忆，是我们正在探索的另一个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d028eafd472686b",
      "translationZh": "超越 AppWorld。这些结果已在 AppWorld 上得到验证——它是一个严谨的多步骤基准，但毕竟只是单一基准。更广泛的智能体基准测试和真实世界部署正在推进中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6bd0e30b07a0ba9",
      "translationZh": "隔离上下文窗口的影响。如上所述，我们希望开展受控实验，将上下文窗口大小与模型本身的能力区分开来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27bb051e56359827",
      "translationZh": "试用 ALTK-Evolve 库——其中包含本文使用的提取、整合和检索流水线——或阅读完整技术报告，了解完整方法和消融实验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "95b17fbc47bc58d8",
      "translationZh": "附录：理解评估指标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d526fb75309ea7d",
      "translationZh": "AppWorld 任务通过两个指标评分，两者均以百分比表示（越高越好）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd1c1062d1f03420",
      "translationZh": "TGC — 任务目标完成率。智能体完整且正确地完成的单个任务所占的比例。这是衡量“是否把事情办成了”的核心指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87eee72deda540ac",
      "translationZh": "SGC — 场景目标完成率。这是一个更严格、非成即败的指标。每个场景包含同一任务的多个变体（同一请求，但数据、措辞或边界条件不同）。只有智能体在每个变体上都成功，SGC 才会将该场景计为通过。它衡量的是可靠性——如果一个智能体大多数时候能解决某项任务，但在其中一个变体上失败，它在 TGC 上可以得分，但在 SGC 上不能得分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
